Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.27,0:00:11.24,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在心灵的街道中{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.41,0:00:17.55,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闪耀着希望之光{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.89,0:00:23.69,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用虚幻的羽翼挥动着梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.16,0:00:30.00,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你与我寻找的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.03,0:00:46.87,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真理总是隐藏在眼中 蓝蓝的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.68,0:00:53.78,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要往何处去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.92,0:01:00.02,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,俩人未来与现今的流浪{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.20,0:01:06.03,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们继续踏上旅程{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.50,0:01:12.46,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远的目标地 无止尽的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.61,0:01:23.61,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望能不放手不断追寻 直到永远{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.12,0:01:48.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,月亮妈妈好像快消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.39,0:01:51.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊！流星！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.86,0:01:57.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望能一直和杀生丸少爷在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.66,0:01:58.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小玲
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.40,0:02:01.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别慢吞吞的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.33,0:02:02.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.60,0:02:05.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奇妙的气氛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.44,0:02:09.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶鬼们…在蠢蠢欲动什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.22,0:02:19.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天是朔日吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.89,0:02:24.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连月亮都有隐藏在黑暗之中的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.46,0:02:29.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被奈落掌握心脏的我 却无处可逃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.63,0:02:31.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.36,0:02:34.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落饲养的魑魅魍魉呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.94,0:02:40.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从结界里消失了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.04,0:02:49.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第66话 奈落的结界 神乐的决心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.99,0:02:58.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.00,0:03:00.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.57,0:03:05.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,稍微休息一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.44,0:03:08.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然身体会撑不住的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.87,0:03:11.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狼群们也上气不接下气了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.44,0:03:12.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.11,0:03:14.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 拿你们没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.95,0:03:16.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是配合你们的脚程
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.85,0:03:19.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,花一百年也到不了奈落城吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.89,0:03:20.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.02,0:03:24.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只是胡乱的跑来跑去不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.16,0:03:26.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我闻到了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.93,0:03:28.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一股令人作呕的妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.53,0:03:32.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落城已经很近了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.67,0:03:37.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一次一定要冲进去宰掉他
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.92,0:04:00.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被他暗算杀害的同伴们的仇…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.23,0:04:02.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要报
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.17,0:04:10.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.94,0:04:12.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道不是这个方向吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.97,0:04:13.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.94,0:04:15.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要跟我说话 我会分心的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.11,0:04:19.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算嗅地面也无法知道奈落城在哪里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.01,0:04:23.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.82,0:04:24.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.62,0:04:26.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的鼻子是不是变的不灵敏啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.32,0:04:28.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚又是朔日耶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.89,0:04:32.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说来 今天是新月呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.19,0:04:33.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朔日吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.63,0:04:34.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.89,0:04:36.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚是犬夜叉失去妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.13,0:04:38.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变成人类姿态的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.40,0:04:42.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 今天不要太勉强了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.47,0:04:43.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算找到了奈落城
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.90,0:04:46.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有妖力的话也无法战斗呀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.64,0:04:47.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.84,0:04:49.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好不容易才到这来的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.84,0:04:53.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是不要太逞强比较…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.85,0:04:57.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…旋风？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.35,0:04:59.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愈来愈接近了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.06,0:05:06.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 戈薇 你也来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.43,0:05:08.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.99,0:05:11.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁叫你一直闻地面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.56,0:05:15.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大烂狗 你也是一路闻过来的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.30,0:05:19.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瘦皮狼…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.51,0:05:21.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浑蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.01,0:05:22.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.74,0:05:24.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.44,0:05:28.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙 你已经找到奈落城了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.51,0:05:31.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 虽然不太清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.82,0:05:34.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是四处散发着奈落那家伙令人作呕的臭味
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.19,0:05:37.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前从来没有这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.02,0:05:37.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.26,0:05:40.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,城的结界比较松散了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.89,0:05:42.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之追着这个臭味
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.53,0:05:44.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定能到达那家伙的城
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.96,0:05:46.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放心吧 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.83,0:05:49.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会杀了奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.40,0:05:51.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算你对我说也…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.97,0:05:53.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行啦 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.21,0:05:55.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要阻止我 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.84,0:05:58.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是今天 我要做个了断
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.04,0:05:59.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都说不要这样了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.61,0:06:01.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 大烂狗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.28,0:06:03.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.48,0:06:08.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那股令人不爽的狗臭味没了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.12,0:06:09.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是洗了澡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.29,0:06:10.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.06,0:06:13.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要靠近我的戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.13,0:06:15.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点分开 臭家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.06,0:06:17.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不甘心的话就分分看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.13,0:06:19.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶~ 等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.56,0:06:20.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.73,0:06:23.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总算追上了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.64,0:06:26.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是做这些事的时候了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.30,0:06:27.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.74,0:06:30.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙 你想逃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.14,0:06:33.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的脑袋我要定了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.38,0:06:37.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下…钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.75,0:06:38.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好 戈薇大姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.08,0:06:39.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,午安
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.95,0:06:41.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思我们先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.32,0:06:45.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 这些家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.59,0:06:47.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要追吗 弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.26,0:06:49.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 今晚不要行动比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.03,0:06:52.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么！别开玩笑了 会被抢先一步的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.53,0:06:55.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你冷静一点 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.40,0:06:56.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙姑且不论
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.60,0:06:59.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想对奈落暴露人类的姿态吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.27,0:07:01.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,半妖失去妖力的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.41,0:07:02.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被知道的话可是攸关性命吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.61,0:07:04.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然对手是奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.61,0:07:06.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要更加小心才是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.35,0:07:08.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.35,0:07:13.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偏偏在这奈落的臭味 四处飘散的关键时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.79,0:07:23.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.00,0:07:26.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这座城真让人透不过气
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.43,0:07:30.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些跟着城被带来的家臣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.64,0:07:32.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也中了奈落结界的毒气
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.07,0:07:34.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部的人都死了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.38,0:07:39.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你啊 神无
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.64,0:07:41.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,突然站在我的身后
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.38,0:07:47.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是叫做钢牙的妖狼族的少主
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.82,0:07:49.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他已经来到这座城附近了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.09,0:07:52.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偶然吗？还是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.46,0:07:55.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 神无
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.53,0:07:57.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落知道这件事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.03,0:08:00.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道…他不在
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.97,0:08:04.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话说回来 奈落那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.97,0:08:07.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候会不在
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.17,0:08:08.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.18,0:08:12.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去杀了那小子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.48,0:08:15.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用不着等奈落的命令吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.41,0:08:17.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样好吗 神乐…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.48,0:08:20.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落那种拐弯抹角的作风
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.85,0:08:22.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我的个性不合
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.69,0:08:24.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,持有四魂碎片的家伙就杀掉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.69,0:08:26.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不需要什么步骤
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.49,0:08:28.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都在奈落手上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.93,0:08:31.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论是生是死
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.70,0:08:35.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是奈落的道具
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.84,0:08:39.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,管他的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.84,0:08:41.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在那家伙不在
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.45,0:08:49.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出现了好奇怪的浓雾
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.71,0:08:51.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么都看不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.95,0:08:53.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.95,0:08:56.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里的臭味最浓
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.35,0:08:58.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该在这附近没错
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.59,0:09:01.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙 上面
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.10,0:09:09.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骷髅跟刀？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.37,0:09:17.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 好久不见了嘛 钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.11,0:09:19.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.88,0:09:25.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么搞的 那些骷髅…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.28,0:09:28.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些是城里的守卫
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.62,0:09:29.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要多少就有多少
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.99,0:09:31.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风使神乐…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.99,0:09:33.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那张讨人厌的嘴脸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.76,0:09:35.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有一天忘掉过
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.63,0:09:39.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎么说 你就是杀害我同伴的元凶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.27,0:09:41.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,觉悟吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.00,0:09:44.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个时候的帐我要全部讨回来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.90,0:09:46.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是一样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.50,0:09:49.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那天没拿到你的四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.41,0:09:51.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天我要定了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.14,0:09:54.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要封住钢牙的速度太简单了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.91,0:09:56.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就跳支舞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.55,0:09:57.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尸舞
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.29,0:10:05.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哼！中看不重用
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.43,0:10:11.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风刃之舞
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.43,0:10:12.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别傻了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.30,0:10:19.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.17,0:10:22.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打中了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.31,0:10:25.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 我要让你再也跑不了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.21,0:10:29.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,龙蛇之舞
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.56,0:10:38.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.82,0:10:40.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骨骸的…漩涡？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.06,0:10:42.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.07,0:10:54.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任选一条路吧 钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.07,0:10:58.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在漩涡中被骨骸削成肉片
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.74,0:11:01.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是跳出来被我剁碎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.85,0:11:03.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用哪种方式我都无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.98,0:11:07.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那样就是算钢牙也撑不住的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.59,0:11:09.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.85,0:11:11.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是凭我们的力量…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.10,0:11:21.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 那娘们一副悠哉的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.37,0:11:24.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是抢走操纵妖气的扇子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.40,0:11:25.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是就赢了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.37,0:11:27.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 还有这一招
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.91,0:11:29.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就偷偷的靠过去抢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.24,0:11:30.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.88,0:11:31.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.61,0:11:34.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋！还没靠近就会被她发现
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.28,0:11:36.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唏哩哗啦的被切碎的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.75,0:11:39.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是要抵抗神乐的风的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.89,0:11:43.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等！是风吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.29,0:11:44.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.76,0:11:45.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 银太
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.26,0:11:48.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别老是擅自行动啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.16,0:11:52.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的结界产生了松弛的情形
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.26,0:11:56.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照钢牙的行动来看应该没错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.04,0:11:59.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得就算只有城的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.14,0:12:01.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是去确认一下比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.31,0:12:04.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是现在又不能带犬夜叉去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.54,0:12:07.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由我和弥勒法师前往就好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.65,0:12:09.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果犬夜叉不听话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.05,0:12:11.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就用戈薇姑娘的“坐下”
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.28,0:12:12.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,封住他的行动
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.55,0:12:14.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,揍他一顿让他安分点
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.92,0:12:17.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又要用这一招啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.06,0:12:20.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.69,0:12:23.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙似乎对被称赞没有抵抗力
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.43,0:12:24.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我想只要捧他一下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.46,0:12:28.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就不会追问犬夜叉的味道的事了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.33,0:12:29.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.20,0:12:31.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也不用对他抛媚眼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.47,0:12:34.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是对那只瘦皮狼太随便了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.17,0:12:36.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才没有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.57,0:12:37.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明明就有
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.94,0:12:39.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.68,0:12:40.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.35,0:12:42.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大姐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.81,0:12:44.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那声音是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.18,0:12:46.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇大姐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.82,0:12:48.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是钢牙的同伴们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.59,0:12:49.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 快躲起来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.32,0:12:54.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.09,0:12:57.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖狼族的人又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.20,0:12:59.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.10,0:13:03.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇大姐 不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.34,0:13:08.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙与神乐正在战斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.11,0:13:11.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之情况对钢牙有点不利
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.98,0:13:12.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.98,0:13:14.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这模样千万不能被看到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.71,0:13:17.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用担心啦 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.62,0:13:20.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我根本没义务要去救钢牙那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.35,0:13:23.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 既然神乐出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.76,0:13:26.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,表示奈落城果然就在这附近
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.99,0:13:28.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落为了不让我们接近
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.76,0:13:31.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理应会仔细的布下结界…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.26,0:13:33.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让人很在意
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.00,0:13:35.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只好去调查看看了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.00,0:13:37.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.50,0:13:40.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你和戈薇好好待着
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.91,0:13:43.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要将人类姿态保密吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.88,0:13:45.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.25,0:13:51.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.65,0:13:52.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呆子一个
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.88,0:13:53.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听好了 你们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.15,0:13:55.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敢把看到的事情说出去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.42,0:13:56.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就宰了你们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.52,0:13:59.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.76,0:14:01.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.43,0:14:03.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然都堵住了他们的嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.16,0:14:05.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.07,0:14:09.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风已经染上你的血腥味了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.44,0:14:13.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再让风转得更猛烈点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.77,0:14:18.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦 钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.41,0:14:20.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吓到不敢出来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.68,0:14:25.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是说…你已经死在里面了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.92,0:14:27.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.32,0:14:31.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论打碎多少骨头
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.69,0:14:32.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是解决不了问题
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.06,0:14:35.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话说回来 要冲出这刀的漩涡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.69,0:14:37.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算是我 身体也会挺不住
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.43,0:14:39.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该怎么办…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.07,0:14:43.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多该让他出来了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.30,0:14:44.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是真的被剁碎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.80,0:14:47.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找起四魂碎片可就辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.81,0:14:49.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会不会死用不着你操心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.48,0:14:54.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么 从上面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.58,0:14:55.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这浑蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.45,0:14:58.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还蛮顽强的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.58,0:14:59.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我想这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.82,0:15:00.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,觉悟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.59,0:15:09.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无法动弹了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.23,0:15:10.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.00,0:15:12.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论用跑的用冲的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.33,0:15:14.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都不可能摆脱我的风的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.47,0:15:16.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风刃
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.34,0:15:25.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.71,0:15:38.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.22,0:15:47.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.33,0:15:50.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,双脚的碎片我收下了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.10,0:15:53.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样你就只是普通的妖怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.13,0:15:57.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多该送你上路了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.60,0:15:59.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.74,0:16:04.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.65,0:16:14.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你捡回一条命了 钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.39,0:16:20.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,逃走了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.99,0:16:22.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 钢牙他…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.76,0:16:27.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.00,0:16:31.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,双脚的四魂碎片都被抢走了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.14,0:16:33.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.27,0:16:36.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好严重的伤 我马上帮你治疗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.91,0:16:38.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那种死了也无所谓的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.38,0:16:39.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别理他了 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.14,0:16:41.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.65,0:16:45.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.18,0:16:47.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是没用啊 钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.15,0:16:49.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然被区区的神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.05,0:16:50.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞的这么狼狈
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.52,0:16:52.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你才是咧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.89,0:16:55.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那什么弱不禁风的模样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.16,0:16:59.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早就在想 犬夜叉这家伙是不是半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.03,0:17:01.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然没错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.40,0:17:04.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根据我听过的传闻
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.10,0:17:07.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,半妖为了保住性命
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.07,0:17:11.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变成人类的时候 绝对不会让敌人看见的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.24,0:17:13.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的胆子真不小
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.01,0:17:17.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然敢以这种模样 在我面前出现
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.78,0:17:19.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.02,0:17:22.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然让你知道了秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.12,0:17:24.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想动手吗 臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.76,0:17:26.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.02,0:17:27.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就在这里送你上路吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.33,0:17:31.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.50,0:17:34.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是从我的国度带来的药
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.07,0:17:36.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对撕裂伤很有效
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.00,0:17:39.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.67,0:17:43.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶的戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.58,0:17:48.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是活该
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.68,0:17:50.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过话说回来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.88,0:17:52.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不只是钢牙他们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.28,0:17:54.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连犬夜叉都来到城附近了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.09,0:18:00.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是奈落的结界变的松散了？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.15,0:18:03.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 现在奈落他…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.65,0:18:05.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不在！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.64,0:18:22.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是痛快
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.87,0:18:24.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.44,0:18:26.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本不用把这些交给奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.18,0:18:29.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要逃的话只有趁
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.34,0:18:32.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的结界变松散的现在
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.61,0:18:35.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是只怕奈落…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.55,0:18:39.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.86,0:18:47.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不要忘了 神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.66,0:18:52.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的心脏随时都掌握在我奈落的手里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.87,0:18:54.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.60,0:18:59.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要让你变回原本的肉块是轻而易举的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.44,0:19:02.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐 你不要忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.64,0:19:04.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底不过是从我奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.91,0:19:07.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诞生的身体的一部分而已
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.18,0:19:10.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可别忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.75,0:19:14.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 不行 还是不行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.96,0:19:21.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我根本就无法逃出那家伙的掌握
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.70,0:19:28.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,流星…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.44,0:19:33.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有这个人不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.18,0:19:37.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.45,0:19:45.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若是那男人的话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.99,0:19:52.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该拥有能切断 我与奈落之间障碍的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.74,0:20:14.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐…你想逃是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.69,0:20:22.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发光了 星星发光了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.22,0:20:25.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷 你看…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.66,0:20:32.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得最近的杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.17,0:20:33.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是心里面充满
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.83,0:20:36.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连身为家臣的我都无法想象到的心事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.24,0:20:38.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好寂寞喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.81,0:20:40.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个小丫头
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.24,0:20:41.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全不知道我的辛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.78,0:20:43.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睡得这么甜
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.81,0:20:46.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.58,0:20:48.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.25,0:20:52.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那家伙的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.02,0:20:56.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.96,0:21:00.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确是曾经冒犯杀生丸少爷您的骗子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.53,0:21:01.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.83,0:21:03.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么他在这附近吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.53,0:21:06.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这 这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.51,0:21:16.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.51,0:21:17.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还“嗨”咧 你不是？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.21,0:21:19.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.81,0:21:22.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也是闻着奈落的味道而来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.05,0:21:24.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.72,0:21:27.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这女人…是奈落的分身
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.72,0:21:30.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫作风使神乐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.89,0:21:35.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真高兴 你还记得我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.40,0:21:39.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手先放开剑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.73,0:21:41.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是来找你打架的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.07,0:21:45.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸 要不要和我交易
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.57,0:21:46.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交易？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.78,0:21:50.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是什么 你应该知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.64,0:21:54.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些四魂碎片 我可以给你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.85,0:21:58.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,条件是…把奈落杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.62,0:21:59.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.32,0:22:03.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我从那家伙的身边解脱
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.90,0:22:20.33,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟要流多少泪{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.87,0:22:27.33,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  才能坦白面对自己
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.65,0:22:33.85,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倘若对谁传达情感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.32,0:22:40.35,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  是否就能得到满足{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.66,0:22:47.12,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害怕着漫长漫长的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.40,0:22:54.13,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝着遥远的星星祈祷着{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.64,0:23:01.07,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.38,0:23:07.98,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找真正的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.12,0:23:14.65,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望自己能够变得更坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.86,0:23:21.39,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天也要抬头看着高高的天空{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.73,0:23:28.16,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中{\fad(150,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.41,0:23:35.00,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找生命的意义{\fad(0,350)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.19,0:23:48.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字是神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.76,0:23:50.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是风 自由自在的活着
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.16,0:23:52.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要背叛吗 神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.73,0:23:53.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了 奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.23,0:23:55.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也是半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.53,0:23:57.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也有变成普通人的时候吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.80,0:23:58.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愚蠢…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.97,0:24:01.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为逃得出我奈落的掌心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.00,0:24:02.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.14,0:24:05.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像风一样自由自在的活着
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.97,0:24:07.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.94,0:24:10.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狂乱飞舞的背叛之风
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.21,0:24:11.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 我看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.98,0:24:13.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你人类的姿态
